Security Resource Prevention:- These are the services that help us to prevent verious types of attack or vulnerabilities.

Aws web application firewall (WAF):- This service used to protect HTTP-based attacks on you web app. 

WEB ACL:- It consists of three diff things. Resource to monitor > Rules-inspection criteria > Action.

AWS Shield:- It is used to detect and mitigate any sophisticated DDoS attacks. 

AWS Network Firewall:- It is used to protect VPCs. It determine what traffic is allowed to enter and leave a VPCs. It is a stateful firewall so it is more intelliget.

Virtual Private Cloud (VPC):- It is used to isolate your resources from other resources. 
